abstract: >-
  Turbo-Suslik is a self-directed system for working with persistent emotional
  reactions, beliefs, fears, internal conflicts, and behavioral patterns. The
  system uses structured verbal instructions called protocols. Instead of trying
  to convince yourself to think positively, a protocol is used to work with the
  memories, emotions, beliefs, bodily reactions, and associations that keep an
  unwanted pattern active.
